    "derived": "per-fill derived block: surplusRaw is executedBuyAmount minus signedBuyAmountLimit in the buy token's smallest unit; executedUsdtPerWbnb is that fill's own executed rate. notionalUsdAtFillPrice, surplusUsdAtFillPrice and feeUsdAtFillPrice are the dollar values of that fill's notional (its executedSellAmount), its surplus and its executedFee, and the rate is applied only to the legs denominated in WBNB: an amount already denominated in USDT is taken at 1 USDT = 1 USD with no rate applied. Six of the eight fills sell USDT and pay executedFee in USDT, so for those the notional and the fee are 1:1 and only the WBNB-denominated surplus uses the rate; the two WBNB-selling fills (grid 2026-08-19 and spike-a 2026-08-18) are the mirror image, notional and fee at the rate and surplus 1:1. feeBps is executedFee over executedSellAmount.",
